  "content": "<p>一個位於天空中的世界，建立在擁有12個方塊的平台上。每個方塊都有獨特主題，包含熾熱的地獄石、高聳的台地、充滿青金石的洞穴、「蛋糕」主題等豐富內容。每個方塊中可能藏有通關所需的特殊物品。</p><p>特色：</p><ul>\n<li>12個主題方塊（+平台）</li>\n<li>初始寶箱內含食物及相關物資</li>\n<li>完整生存模式體驗</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>常見問答</h1><p>問：什麼是天空方塊？<br>答：天空方塊是一張地圖，您與12個方塊將被困在天空之中。</p><p><br>問：這張地圖會隨著每次遊戲更新而更新嗎？<br>答：是的，我們會持續更新。地圖內容不太可能進行大幅更動。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>相片集</h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fcd634a7-4c58-4388-9dae-d396d3aad68d.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0147662b-0b8b-42c5-9d84-082dab6196cf.png\" width=\"217\" height=\"123\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7f7c9940-4e88-4329-9848-caaedec34cbe.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4a1e6c16-5435-4df0-9123-4fbde6f2dad0.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4bd18a4-9f7b-4445-9d93-7e3e31de1487.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84ea0c15-ba99-462e-b8fd-4991564fa07b.png\" width=\"213\" height=\"119\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8316b28a-dfb6-4fff-8fcf-421946a25b70.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f34077db-5aad-43fd-8b70-4cd9ce88085a.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3d7504d8-866d-4b4c-8af5-8f7b7bc9e449.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f68dce6-6e64-41cb-8ffa-7fa0b6385a88.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9c8093b2-05ce-454d-9549-141d82faa30f.png\" width=\"212\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_797c4235-d801-4c9f-b380-0ceb3bab88d0.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"122\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_896c1ce7-bd89-47bf-8020-8aa5fd00df69.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"121\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
